{"id":"trampa","lemma":"trampa","pos":"noun","rank":961,"glosses":["trap, snare","cheating, cheat (violation of rules to gain an advantage)","trapdoor (hinged or sliding door set into a floor)"],"ipa":"/ˈtɾampa/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"trampas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/7a/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-trampa.wav","examples":[{"text":"¿Acaso es una trampa?","en":"Is it a trap?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/438139"},{"text":"Sé que Tom hizo trampas.","en":"I know Tom cheated.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/800336"},{"text":"¿Es esto una trampa?","en":"Is this a hoax?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/441074"},{"text":"Tom no está haciendo trampas.","en":"Tom isn't cheating.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/800335"},{"text":"Esto es una trampa.","en":"This is a trap.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/441222"}]}